<title>HONG KONG: SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA WIN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH KOREA WIN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONG KONG, Feb 22, Reuter - Result of a World Cup Asian Zone first round group 6 qualifier on Saturday:</p>
<p> Hong Kong    0    South Korea     2  (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Seo Jung-won 61, Choi Moon-sik 75th.</p>
<p>Next group 6 match: Thailand v South Korea, March 2, Bangkok.</p>
</text>
